{"id":"torrey:jerusalem","source":"torrey","name":"Jerusalem","slug":"jerusalem","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The ancient Salem — Ge 14:18; Ps 76:2.","refs":[["Gen",14,18,14,18],["Ps",76,2,76,2]]},{"text":"The ancient Jebusi or Jebus — Jos 15:8; 18:28; Jdj 19:10.","refs":[["Josh",15,8,15,8],["Josh",18,28,18,28],["Judg",19,10,19,10]]},{"text":"The king of, defeated and slain by Joshua — Jos 10:5-23.","refs":[["Josh",10,5,10,23]]},{"text":"Allotted to the tribe of Benjamin — Jos 18:28.","refs":[["Josh",18,28,18,28]]},{"text":"Partly taken and burned by Judah — Jdj 1:8.","refs":[["Judg",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Formerly dwelt in. — Jdj 19:10,11.","refs":[["Judg",19,10,19,10],["Judg",19,11,19,11]]},{"text":"Held possession of, with Judah and Benjamin. — Jos 15:63; Jdj 1:21.","refs":[["Josh",15,63,15,63],["Judg",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Finally dispossessed of, by David. — 2Sa 5:6-8.","refs":[["2Sam",5,6,5,8]]},{"text":"Enlarged by David — 2Sa 5:9.","refs":[["2Sam",5,9,5,9]]},{"text":"Made the royal city — 2Sa 5:9; 20:3.","refs":[["2Sam",5,9,5,9],["2Sam",20,3,20,3]]},{"text":"Specially chosen by God — 2Ch 6:6; Ps 135:21.","refs":[["2Chr",6,6,6,6],["Ps",135,21,135,21]]},{"text":"The seat of government under the Romans for a time — Mt 27:2,19.","refs":[["Matt",27,2,27,2],["Matt",27,19,27,19]]},{"text":"Roman government transferred from, to Caesarea — Ac 23:23,24; 25:1-13.","refs":[["Acts",23,23,23,23],["Acts",23,24,23,24],["Acts",25,1,25,13]]},{"text":"City of God. — Ps 46:4; 48:1.","refs":[["Ps",46,4,46,4],["Ps",48,1,48,1]]},{"text":"City of the Lord. — Isa 60:14.","refs":[["Isa",60,14,60,14]]},{"text":"City of Judah. — 2Ch 25:28.","refs":[["2Chr",25,28,25,28]]},{"text":"City of the great king. — Ps 48:2; Mt 5:5.","refs":[["Ps",48,2,48,2],["Matt",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"City of solemnities. — Isa 33:20.","refs":[["Isa",33,20,33,20]]},{"text":"City of righteousness. — Isa 1:26.","refs":[["Isa",1,26,1,26]]},{"text":"City of truth. — Zec 8:3.","refs":[["Zech",8,3,8,3]]},{"text":"A city not forsaken. — Isa 62:12.","refs":[["Isa",62,12,62,12]]},{"text":"Faithful city. — Isa 1:21,26.","refs":[["Isa",1,21,1,21],["Isa",1,26,1,26]]},{"text":"Holy city. — Ne 11:1; Isa 48:2; Mt 4:5.","refs":[["Neh",11,1,11,1],["Isa",48,2,48,2],["Matt",4,5,4,5]]},{"text":"Throne of the Lord. — Jer 3:17.","refs":[["Jer",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Zion. — Ps 48:12; Isa 33:20.","refs":[["Ps",48,12,48,12],["Isa",33,20,33,20]]},{"text":"Zion of the holy one of Israel. — Isa 60:14.","refs":[["Isa",60,14,60,14]]},{"text":"Surrounded by mountains — Ps 125:2.","refs":[["Ps",125,2,125,2]]},{"text":"Surrounded by a wall — 1Ki 3:1.","refs":[["1Kgs",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Protected by forts and bulwarks — Ps 48:12,13.","refs":[["Ps",48,12,48,12],["Ps",48,13,48,13]]},{"text":"Entered by gates — Ps 122:2; Jer 17:19-21.","refs":[["Ps",122,2,122,2],["Jer",17,19,17,21]]},{"text":"Hezekiah made an aqueduct for — 2Ki 20:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Spoils of war placed in — 1Sa 17:54; 2Sa 8:7.","refs":[["1Sam",17,54,17,54],["2Sam",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Beautiful for situation. — Ps 48:2.","refs":[["Ps",48,2,48,2]]},{"text":"Compact. — Ps 122:3.","refs":[["Ps",122,3,122,3]]},{"text":"Comely. — Song 6:4.","refs":[["Song",6,4,6,4]]},{"text":"The perfection of beauty. — La 2:15.","refs":[["Lam",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Joy of the whole earth. — Ps 48:2; La 2:15.","refs":[["Ps",48,2,48,2],["Lam",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Princess among the provinces. — La 1:1.","refs":[["Lam",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Great. — Jer 22:8.","refs":[["Jer",22,8,22,8]]},{"text":"Populous. — La 1:1.","refs":[["Lam",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Full of business and tumult. — Isa 22:3.","refs":[["Isa",22,3,22,3]]},{"text":"Wealth, & c in the time of Solomon. — 1Ki 10:26,27.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,26,10,26],["1Kgs",10,27,10,27]]},{"text":"Protected by God — Isa 31:5.","refs":[["Isa",31,5,31,5]]},{"text":"Instances of God’s care and protection of — 2Sa 24:16; 2Ki 19:32-34; 2Ch 12:7.","refs":[["2Sam",24,16,24,16],["2Kgs",19,32,19,34],["2Chr",12,7,12,7]]},{"text":"The temple built in — 2Ch 3:1; Ps 68:29.","refs":[["2Chr",3,1,3,1],["Ps",68,29,68,29]]},{"text":"Went up to, at the feasts. — Lu 2:42; Ps 122:4.","refs":[["Luke",2,42,2,42],["Ps",122,4,122,4]]},{"text":"Loved. — Ps 137:5,6.","refs":[["Ps",137,5,137,5],["Ps",137,6,137,6]]},{"text":"Lamented the affliction of. — Ne 1:2-4.","refs":[["Neh",1,2,1,4]]},{"text":"Prayed for the prosperity of. — Ps 51:18; 122:6.","refs":[["Ps",51,18,51,18],["Ps",122,6,122,6]]},{"text":"Prayed towards. — Da 6:10; 1Ki 8:41.","refs":[["Dan",6,10,6,10],["1Kgs",8,41,8,41]]},{"text":"Wickedness of — Isa 1:1-4; Jer 5:1-5; Mic 3:10.","refs":[["Isa",1,1,1,4],["Jer",5,1,5,5],["Mic",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Idolatry of — 2Ch 28:4; Eze 8:7-10.","refs":[["2Chr",28,4,28,4],["Ezek",8,7,8,10]]},{"text":"Wickedness of, the cause of its calamities — 2Ki 21:12-15; 2Ch 24:18; La 1:8; Eze 5:5-8.","refs":[["2Kgs",21,12,21,15],["2Chr",24,18,24,18],["Lam",1,8,1,8],["Ezek",5,5,5,8]]},{"text":"Was the tomb of the prophets — Lu 13:33,34.","refs":[["Luke",13,33,13,33],["Luke",13,34,13,34]]},{"text":"Preached in. — Lu 21:37,38; Joh 18:20.","refs":[["Luke",21,37,21,37],["Luke",21,38,21,38],["John",18,20,18,20]]},{"text":"Did many miracles in. — Joh 4:45.","refs":[["John",4,45,4,45]]},{"text":"Publicly entered, as king. — Mt 21:9,10.","refs":[["Matt",21,9,21,9],["Matt",21,10,21,10]]},{"text":"Lamented over. — Mt 23:37; Lu 19:41.","refs":[["Matt",23,37,23,37],["Luke",19,41,19,41]]},{"text":"Put to death at. — Lu 9:31; Ac 13:27,29.","refs":[["Luke",9,31,9,31],["Acts",13,27,13,27],["Acts",13,29,13,29]]},{"text":"Gospel first preached at — Lu 24:47; Ac 2:14.","refs":[["Luke",24,47,24,47],["Acts",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Miraculous gift of the Holy Spirit first given at — Ac 1:4; 2:1-5.","refs":[["Acts",1,4,1,4],["Acts",2,1,2,5]]},{"text":"Persecution of the Christian church commenced at — Ac 4:1; 8:1.","refs":[["Acts",4,1,4,1],["Acts",8,1,8,1]]},{"text":"First Christian council held at — Ac 15:4,6.","refs":[["Acts",15,4,15,4],["Acts",15,6,15,6]]},{"text":"Taken and plundered by Shishak. — 1Ki 14:25,26; 2Ch 12:1-4.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,25,14,25],["1Kgs",14,26,14,26],["2Chr",12,1,12,4]]},{"text":"Taken and plundered by Jehoash king of Israel. — 2Ki 14:13,14.","refs":[["2Kgs",14,13,14,13],["2Kgs",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Besieged but not taken by Rezin and Pekah. — Isa 7:1; 2Ki 16:5.","refs":[["Isa",7,1,7,1],["2Kgs",16,5,16,5]]},{"text":"Besieged but not taken by Sennacherib. — 2Ki 18:17; 19:1-37.","refs":[["2Kgs",18,17,18,17],["2Kgs",19,1,19,37]]},{"text":"Taken and made tributary by Pharaoh-Necho. — 2Ki 23:33-35.","refs":[["2Kgs",23,33,23,35]]},{"text":"Besieged by Nebuchadnezzar. — 2Ki 24:10,11.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,10,24,10],["2Kgs",24,11,24,11]]},{"text":"Taken and burned by Nebuchadnezzar. — 2Ki 25:1-30; Jer 39:1-8.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,1,25,30],["Jer",39,1,39,8]]},{"text":"Threatened by Sanballat. — Ne 4:7,8.","refs":[["Neh",4,7,4,7],["Neh",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Rebuilt after the captivity by order of Cyrus — Ezr 1:1-4.","refs":[["Ezra",1,1,1,4]]},{"text":"To be taken by king of Babylon. — Jer 20:5.","refs":[["Jer",20,5,20,5]]},{"text":"To be made a heap of ruins. — Jer 9:11; 26:18.","refs":[["Jer",9,11,9,11],["Jer",26,18,26,18]]},{"text":"To be a wilderness. — Isa 64:10.","refs":[["Isa",64,10,64,10]]},{"text":"To be rebuilt by Cyrus. — Isa 44:26-28.","refs":[["Isa",44,26,44,28]]},{"text":"To be a quiet habitation. — Isa 33:20.","refs":[["Isa",33,20,33,20]]},{"text":"To be a terror to her enemies. — Zec 12:2,3.","refs":[["Zech",12,2,12,2],["Zech",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"Christ to enter, as king. — Zec 9:9.","refs":[["Zech",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"The gospel to go forth from. — Isa 2:3; 40:9.","refs":[["Isa",2,3,2,3],["Isa",40,9,40,9]]},{"text":"To be destroyed by the Romans. — Lu 19:42-44.","refs":[["Luke",19,42,19,44]]},{"text":"Its capture accompanied by severe calamities. — Mt 24:21,29; Lu 21:23,24.","refs":[["Matt",24,21,24,21],["Matt",24,29,24,29],["Luke",21,23,21,23],["Luke",21,24,21,24]]},{"text":"Signs preceding its destruction. — Mt 24:6-15; Lu 21:7-11,25,28.","refs":[["Matt",24,6,24,15],["Luke",21,7,21,11],["Luke",21,25,21,25],["Luke",21,28,21,28]]},{"text":"Of the church. — Ga 4:25,26; Heb 12:22.","refs":[["Gal",4,25,4,25],["Gal",4,26,4,26],["Heb",12,22,12,22]]},{"text":"Of the church glorified. — Re 3:12; 21:2,10.","refs":[["Rev",3,12,3,12],["Rev",21,2,21,2],["Rev",21,10,21,10]]},{"text":"(Its strong position,) of saints under God’s protection. — Ps 125:2.","refs":[["Ps",125,2,125,2]]}],"refCount":152}
